- P5 allows Constant-space references mid-segment, so any inspected value may live in ProgramBlock Constants/ConstantFields rather than Data/DataFields.
- These rules are recorded as having "no additional ProgramBlock dereference":
  - A161/A165/A169 (Bool/variant test);
